  "configuration_id": "config_004",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only scvi_n200 multiprofile is the strongest unimodal direction (0.650 avgpool, 0.653 transformer), and multiprofile helped pca_n2000 versus singleprofile, but scvi singleprofile is untested. config_004 directly tests whether the profile/aggregation gain is general to the best RNA encoder by changing only profile setting relative to config_005/006. This is the best next use of budget because it isolates an important design choice, avoids assuming multiprofile is necessary, and will determine whether later multimodal tests should use a simpler singleprofile or keep multiprofile aggregation."
}

